  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow slams into your hip, snapping the neck of the femur. A fracture like that is difficult to set, with a good chance of healing crooked.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Prone], @Condition[Stunned] (1) and suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.2iult41Jehz0F1O8]{Broken Bone (Major)}.</p><p>Extraction will be <strong>Hard (-20)</strong>, requiring the arrowhead being pushed through to emerge from the lower gluteal region.</p>"
    },
